      "metadata": {
        "role": "Summoner, healer and fear-resistant wilderness expert",
        "progression": "Lineage +2 Wis; racial Skill Expert +1 Wis; Druid 4 +2 Wis. Amulet replaces native Con 8 with 19.",
        "grim_hollow": {
          "kind": "item",
          "name": "Telltale Heart"
        },
        "import_notes": "Enter 147 gp. Amulet Constitution and AC 16 are already included; apply War Caster concentration advantage and the heart's fear-save advantage conditionally. Track Spirit Totem and Wild Shape. No summons, familiar, Aid or temporary HP start active. Native Constitution without the amulet is 8.",
        "tactics": [
          "Conjure allies using a DM-selected legal beast option. Summon Bear Spirit afterward so chosen creatures in its initial aura receive 12 temporary HP.",
          "Use Unicorn Spirit instead for group recovery: a slot Healing Word restores its normal amount and adds 7 HP to each chosen creature in the aura. Goodberry eating does not activate it.",
          "Keep concentration protected, use terrain/cover, and avoid replacing Conjure Animals with another concentration spell unintentionally. Use the heart against fear and on important lore checks."
        ],
