      "metadata": {
        "role": "Fast-acting fate controller and investigator",
        "progression": "Lineage +2 Int; racial Fey Touched +1 Int; Wizard 4 +2 Int. House Alert has no ASI. No stat-setting item.",
        "grim_hollow": {
          "kind": "item",
          "name": "Ring of Hidden Desire"
        },
        "import_notes": "Enter 299 gp. Set initiative bonus +5 beyond Dexterity, giving +7 total. Grimoire bonuses require holding it and are included. AC starts at 12; change to 15 after casting Mage Armor and spend its slot. No buff or familiar starts active. Record two Portent dice, ring charges and five-level Arcane Recovery manually.",
        "tactics": [
          "Use +7 initiative to land Web, Hypnotic Pattern, Slow or Polymorph early. Use a LOW recorded Portent before an important enemy save, not after seeing its roll.",
          "For investigation, a suitably low Portent can help the ring reveal a target's desire; the item only reveals information and does not compel behavior.",
          "After expending slots, a slotted See Invisibility can recover a 1st-level slot through Expert Divination. Use Arcane Recovery separately once per day, up to five total slot levels."
        ],
